# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto
*.wasm binary
*.png binary
*.whl binary
*.zip binary
# The page checks every release file against the SHA-256 that release/manifest.json names for it, and GitHub Pages
# serves the bytes git stores: git keeps release/ byte for byte (renut_nx_ultimate_installer, from blur-nx-installer).
release/** -text
